# GreenVapor Linux — ShowUnownedStatus (Non-Steam Shortcut Presence) Patch
#
# Target: rafie-slsteam-moon (x64 steamrt64)
# Files:
#   1. src/config.hpp      (MTVariable<bool> showUnownedStatus)
#   2. src/config.cpp      (ShowUnownedStatus YAML key, default false, hot-reloaded)
#   3. src/feats/apps.cpp  (Apps::sendGamesPlayed non-Steam shortcut encoding)
#
# Behavior:
#   When ShowUnownedStatus: yes is set in ~/.config/SLSsteam/config.yaml and no
#   explicit FakeAppIds mapping exists for an unowned/managed app, SLSsteam
#   encodes ONLY the outbound CMsgClientGamesPlayed status entry as a Steam
#   non-Steam shortcut ID (CGameID type=2 -> 0x02000000) with game_extra_info
#   set to the game's real title (common/name).
#   - Does NOT change the Steamworks AppID seen by the game.
#   - Runs after CloudRedirect's CCMInterface::Send observer, so saves and
#     playtime tracking continue to observe the real AppID.
#   - Hot-reloads via CFileWatcher when toggled from gvlinux or Decky Loader.
